      "deceased_name": "GREENAGE.-Died in Cheswold, Del",
      "age": "",
      "birth_date": "",
      "death_date": "1905",
      "cemetery_location": "",
      "full_text": "GREENAGE.-Died in Cheswold, Del., September 18, 1905, of consumption, Benjamin \n  Greenage, aged twenty-five years. Brother Greenage accepted the truth about \n  five years ago. After having run well for a little season, he fell away. But \n  he made a fresh start within the last year, and died in hope, deeply regretting \n  that he had not studied the word of God more faithfully. Words of comfort were \n  spoken to a large audience from Hosea 13 :14. - reported by JOHN F. JONES.",
